  tier       tickets mean_p_hat share_wanting_refund true_tau tau_hat      se
  <chr>        <int>      <dbl>                <dbl>    <dbl>   <dbl>   <dbl>
1 enterprise    4878      0.735                0.744  -0.124  -0.119  0.0121 
2 free         16314      0.734                0.750   0.0626  0.0550 0.00659
3 standard     11517      0.732                0.744   0.0617  0.0549 0.00785
